OL,3,GNEWSAWalsall Illuminations could make a
OL,4,Adazzling return
OL,5,
OL,6,FA popular family festival may be set to
OL,7,Freturn to the Black Country after a
OL,8,Fcouncil said it was in "advanced talks"
OL,9,Fto bring it back, 15 years after it was
OL,10,Fscrapped.
OL,12,FWalsall Illuminations was first held in
OL,13,F1951 at the town's arboretum as part of
OL,14,Fthe Festival of Britain, running until
OL,15,F2008 before being stopped for good by
OL,16,Fthe then-Conservative administration in
OL,17,F2011 due to falling visitor numbers.
OL,19,FThe event featured laser shows,
OL,20,Flakeside displays and other light
OL,21,Fperformances.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
