OL,3,GNEWSAWalsall Illuminations could make a
OL,4,Adazzling return
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow, the deputy leader of the
OL,7,Fauthority's Reform administration said
OL,8,Fdiscussions for its return were
OL,9,F"ongoing" and residents should have
OL,10,Fsome "positive news very soon".
